1
00:00:00,161 --> 00:00:03,441
(Sheldon:)Of course, my grandfather
died when I was five.

2
00:00:03,598 --> 00:00:06,078
(Sheldon:)My father died when I was 14.

3
00:00:06,234 --> 00:00:09,114
(Arthur:)I'm... I'm sorry about that.

4
00:00:09,271 --> 00:00:11,111
(Sheldon:)And now you're gone, too.

5
00:00:12,674 --> 00:00:15,714
(Sheldon:)It's like all the men I've
looked up to have gone away.

6
00:00:17,445 --> 00:00:21,125
(Arthur:)Well, you know, it's...
it's OK to...

7
00:00:21,249 --> 00:00:22,789
(Arthur:)...to be sad about them.

8
00:00:22,951 --> 00:00:27,731
(Arthur:)Just... just make sure,
you know, you appreciate...

9
00:00:27,789 --> 00:00:30,289
(Arthur:)...those who...
who are still there for you.

10
00:00:31,960 --> 00:00:34,100
(Sheldon:)But I do appreciate them.

11
00:00:35,463 --> 00:00:36,963
(Arthur:)Well, then...

12
00:00:37,132 --> 00:00:41,082
(Arthur:)...what am I doing in a swamp...

13
00:00:44,806 --> 00:00:47,716
(Arthur:)...dressed like Friar Tuck?

14
00:00:53,982 --> 00:00:59,022
(Arthur:)Appreciate them, Sheldon.

